  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This newly constructed Lakeside luxury home features a large private pool (heated upon request) with a tanning ledge and enough room to host 22 guests. Cabana Cove is located in the heart of Blue Mountain Beach. Entrance to the Beach is under a 2-minute golf cart, or a 7-minute walk. We are also just a stone's throw from Red Fish Taco (Great live music venue) and Blue Mountain Creamery! Enjoy our 6-seater golf cart, a chef’s dream gourmet kitchen, and a beautifully wooded neighborhood with excellent nearby food and drink options. Not only do we have a private pool, but there is also a large community pool, a playground, and a park within the neighborhood, less than a minute walk from the house. For the rainy days, we have a ping pong table set up in our garage. The beach is 0.4 miles from our home.<br><br>*Private pool with tanning ledge and lounge chairs <br>*6-Seater golf cart that makes it easier to travel around Blue Mountain Beach<br>*Spacious screened porch with outdoor dining table for eight and cozy seating overlooking the pool<br>*Gourmet kitchen with oversized fridge/freezer, gas range with griddle, under-counter ice maker, drip coffee maker & Keurig<br>*Indoor dining area seats 8, plus island seating for 4<br>*Open living area with plenty of seating and a large Smart TV<br>*Gas-plumbed grill — never worry about running out of fuel<br>*2-car garage with tournament-quality ping pong table<br>*4 king suites with ensuite bathrooms and large Smart TVs (2 with private screened porches)<br>*Master suite includes walk-in shower, dual vanities, and Smart TV<br>*Main bunk area sleeps 10 with two queen-over-queen custom-built-ins, queen sleeper sofa, lounge area, 65” Smart TV, and desk<br>*Separate bunk room sleeps 6 with two twin-over-full built-ins, Smart TV, and privacy door<br>*Full bathroom with tub/shower combo on the third floor<br>*Plenty of beach chairs to use at the beach<br>*Multiple porches for lounging and enjoying fresh air without the crowds<br>*Community Pool and Playground within neighborhood<br>*Minimum age to rent is 25<br><br>Pool heating is available for $55 per day. Please notify us at least 24 hours in advance if you’d like the pool heated<br><br>** Our HOA neighborhood does not allow RV, U-Haul, trailer parking, or street parking ** Drive way can fit up to 4 vehicles with more parking available in the neighborhood.<br><br>Golf Cart Policy: Please note that we will need a card on file, a copy of your driver's license, and proof of insurance to be received per cart before your arrival.<br><br>Starter Pack: We provide our guests with a starter amenity pack of Gilchrist & Soames hand and body soaps, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, toilet paper, trash can liners, paper towels, dish soap, dishwasher pods, dish sponges, coffee packs, and laundry detergent pods. Once the initial amenities are depleted, guests are responsible for supplying their own amenities.<br><br>Cancellation Policy: 100% refund when bookings are cancelled 60 days (or more) before the start of the stay. Bookings canceled between 59 and 30 days before the start of stay will receive a 50% refund. For your protection, we encourage you to procure Traveler’s Insurance. Guests are required to electronically sign the rental agreement within TWO days of booking; otherwise, the reservation is subject to cancellation.<br><br>The Beyond Blue Difference: Our vacation homes are maintained above and beyond industry standards to remove any worry and make your stay with us an ideal, memorable vacation. Each home is professionally cleaned, services verified, and inspected before each guest's arrival. Our guest service team is available 7 days a week to help you before and during your stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
